story-context.interfaces:
**Input Component Interface (Shadcn UI):**
```typescript
// will-it-rain/components/ui/input.tsx
interface InputProps extends React.ComponentProps<"input"> {
  className?: string
  type?: string
  // Add mobile-specific props:
  inputMode?: "text" | "tel" | "url" | "email" | "numeric" | "decimal" | "search"
  autoComplete?: string
  autoCorrect?: "on" | "off"
  autoCapitalize?: "none" | "sentences" | "words" | "characters"
}
```

**HomePage Input Field Configuration:**
```tsx
// will-it-rain/app/page.tsx (lines 121-137)
 setLocation(e.target.value)}
  disabled={isLoading}
  className="text-center text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl h-12 sm:h-14 md:h-16 w-full"
  aria-label="Location input - Enter your zipcode or city name"
  autoComplete="off"
  // ADD: Mobile keyboard optimizations
  inputMode="text"
  autoCorrect="off"
  autoCapitalize="words"
/>
```

**Viewport Meta Tag Configuration:**
```tsx
// will-it-rain/app/layout.tsx
export const metadata: Metadata = {
  // ... existing metadata
  viewport: {
    width: "device-width",
    initialScale: 1,
    maximumScale: 5, // Allow zoom for accessibility
    userScalable: true, // Don't disable pinch-zoom
  }
}
```

**Touch-Action CSS (Alternative to viewport restrictions):**
```css
/* will-it-rain/app/globals.css */
/* Prevent double-tap zoom on interactive elements while preserving pinch-zoom */
button,
input,
[role="button"] {
  touch-action: manipulation;
}
```
